  "description": "Called a Red Rose, the evil Rosetta Cliff in the novel 'The Love Left Behind by the Moon Girl'. She abuses her step-daughter, Clarissa.She is eventually destined to meet her death by Clarissa's brother, Terran.\n\nThe former Red Rose, the present Rosetta, tries to change her life in order to escape her own predestined death...\n\n*\"What? Clarissa called me directly? Her brother is even asking me to marry him under contract?\"*\n\nRosetta, now wandering between pioneering a new life for herself and her inevitable destiny, continues to live in hardships even today.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
